---@field indexesUsed? gcp.unstable.firestore_v1beta1.DocumentMapList The indexes selected for the query. For example: [ {"query_scope": "Collection", "properties": "(foo ASC, __name__ ASC)"}, {"query_scope": "Collection", "properties": "(bar ASC, __name__ ASC)"} ]

