---@class gcp.unstable.firestore_v1beta1.ReadOnly
---@field readTime? string Reads documents at the given time. This must be a microsecond precision timestamp within the past one hour, or if Point-in-Time Recovery is enabled, can additionally be a whole minute timestamp within the past 7 days.

---Options for a transaction that can be used to read and write documents.
