---@field concurrencyMode? gcp.unstable.firestore_v1beta1.ReadWriteConcurrencyModeEnum|string Optional. The concurrency control mode to use for this transaction. A database is able to use different concurrency modes for different transactions simultaneously. 3rd party auth requests are only allowed to create optimistic read-write transactions and must specify that here even if the database-level setting is already configured to optimistic.

